    {
      "id": "3r8cro7",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "13. MCLR (MARGINAL COST OF FUNDS BASED LENDING RATE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Regional Rural Banks (RRBs) were established following the Narasimham Working Group recommendations and governed by the RRB Act, 1976.",
        "MCLR (Marginal Cost of Funds based Lending Rate) was introduced by RBI in April 2016 to improve monetary policy transmission.",
        "Domestic commercial banks must mandate 40% of ANBC towards Priority Sector Lending, whereas RRBs and Small Finance Banks have a target of 75%."
      ],
      "id": "mup21e3"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "azeluqb",
      "content": "MCLR is the minimum interest rate below which banks cannot lend (except special cases)."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "az5a7ul",
      "content": "Introduced in 2016 to improve monetary policy transmission."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "qioz90j",
      "content": "It replaced the Base Rate system."
    },
    {
      "id": "5d37era",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "14. MAJOR BANKING REFORMS"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "uygcon5",
      "content": "• Bank Nationalisation (1969 &amp; 1980)<br></br>• Narasimham Committee Reforms (1991 &amp; 1998)<br></br>• Basel III Implementation<br></br>• Insolvency and Bankruptcy Code (2016)<br></br>• Bank mergers and recapitalisation<br></br>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "f0aggyg",
      "content": "Objective: Strengthen banks and reduce NPAs."
    },
    {
      "id": "2c1gdgn",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "15. RRB IMPORTANT ONE-LINERS"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "cas2nqe",
      "content": "• Banking Regulation Act – 1949<br></br>• 14 banks nationalised in 1969<br></br>• NPA overdue period – 90 days<br></br>• Credit Multiplier = 1/CRR<br></br>• RBI regulates banking system<br></br>"
    }
  ],
  "enriched": true
}